<title>UK: TABLE- Severn Trent pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Severn Trent pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		   93.9 *	    vs    89.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    22.16	     vs    19.33</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)    36.5		vs    32.37</p>
<p> Pretax			  391 *	     vs    373</p>
<p> Turnover			1,215	     vs    1,158</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 381 and 395 million stg.</p>
<p>*Both pre-tax profits and earnings per share are pre-exceptionals. The exceptional charges are mainly the provision for further restructuring of 20 million stg and 4.5 million stg exceptional costs linked to proposed bid for South West water.</p>
<p>Full company name - Severn Trent Plc.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
